WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.600
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: The Prompt Formula: Role, Task, Context, Format.

2
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.294
Write a prompt that gets a better answer. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:19.668
Step one. Role. Tell the AI who to be. For example, you are an English teacher.

4
00:00:20.683 --> 00:00:27.242
Step two. Task. Say clearly what you want. For example, write five sentences about my family.

5
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.623
Step three. Context. Give details. For example, I am a beginner, age fourteen.

6
00:00:35.617 --> 00:00:44.987
Step four. Format. Say how the answer should look. For example, a numbered list with simple words. Copy this formula and use it every day.

7
00:00:45.983 --> 00:00:50.029
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:50.329 --> 00:00:52.247
Write a prompt with all four parts.

9
00:00:52.547 --> 00:00:57.217
Ask the AI for a 5-sentence text about your hobby.

10
00:00:57.517 --> 00:01:00.051
Change the Format to a table and compare.

11
00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:01.352
Well done!

